~ start
set voice_pitch = 0.7
if not shady_encountered
	=> first_encounter

if has_autograph
	=> receive_autograph
else
	=> second_encounter

=> END

~ first_encounter
???: Psst. You there.
if not player_clothed
	???: Naked guy.
???: Saw ya snoopin' around the entrance to the "clubhouse".
???: If ya wanna get in there, you're gonna need a few things. Things I might be able to help you with.
???: I used to be a member see, 'till I got kicked out for "cheatin' at poker every time I play."
???: I kept tellin' em, "You can't cheat at poker! You're [wave]supposed[/wave] to bring extra cards!"
???: Anywho, I digress. First off, the bouncer don't let nobody in 'less they bribe him. 
???: I happen to know that he enjoys collectin' antiques; do with that what you will.
???: Second, ya gonna need the password. Changes every day, but my buddy knows what it is.
???: Unfortunately, he got locked up this mornin'. Maybe you could pay him a visit.
???: Lastly, all the club members wear matching rings. 
???: I've still got mine, and I'd be willin' to lend it to ya in exchange for somethin' of value.
???: Somethin' I could pawn quick and easy. Signed baseball card, gold necklace, a kidney. You name it, I'm flexible.
???: Bring me somethin' like that and this ring is yours.
set shady_encountered = true
=> END

~ second_encounter
???: Like I said, you need a bribe, a password, and a ring to get in.
???: Get me something valuable, and I might be able to part with this old jewlery o' mine.
if not player_clothed
	???: And maybe, just maybe, put on some clothes. 
	???: [wave]NOBODY[/wave] wants to see all that!
=> END

~ receive_autograph
???: Well, well, well, what do we have here?
???: A signed headshot of Mayor Bronto? Now that might be worth somethin'.
???: A deal's a deal kid, ring's yours. Here, catch.
set ring_thrown = true
do remove_item("ThadPhoto")
=> END

~ ring_dropped
???: Ahh, dino nuggets. Well, it belongs to the sewers now. See ya kid!
set ring_in_water = true
set shady_quest_complete = true
=> END